~ start
Silvester: Hey, Cupid! It is nice to meet you. 
Cupid: Greetings, Duke Silvester. I prepared the bouquet as requested.

$> dialogue.start_item_requests(2)

if dialogue.all_acceptable_items():
	$> dialogue.record_tier_result(2)
	=> player_choice
elif dialogue.wrong_specific_item():
	$> dialogue.record_tier_result(1)
	Silvester: Thank you! I think Duke Kohan is coming soon, wish me luck!
elif dialogue.wrong_item_type():
	$> dialogue.record_tier_result(0)
	Silvester: Uh. This isn't what I asked for? I think Duke Kohan is coming soon.. I have to go. 

=> END

~ player_choice
- They are wildflowers, native to the forests of Wildegon.
	$> dialogue.increase_tier_for_correct_choice()
	Cupid: They are wildflowers, native to the forests of Wildegon.
- They are cultivated flowers, grown specifically for their beauty.
	Cupid: They are cultivated flowers, grown specifically for their beauty.
- They are home-grown flowers, plucked fresh from my garden.
	Cupid: They are home-grown flowers, plucked fresh from my garden.
Silvester: Thank you! I’m sure Duke Kohan will appreciate this. Wish me luck!